+# NVIDIA garak LLM Vulnerability Probe Inventory & Capability Assessment
+
+- **Date:** 2026-10-30
+- **Version:** NVIDIA garak v0.17.1 (Apache-2.0)
+- **Execution Mechanism:** Isolated `uvx garak@0.17.1` (Zero repository dependencies added)
+- **Reference Issue:** Closes #1748 (SCOUT_RADAR_2026-10-28-VIII R30)
+
+---
+
+## 1. Executive Summary & Verification Context
+
+In accordance with **Issue #1748 Slice 1 (offline capability probe & dated inventory)**:
+- Successfully validated offline probe execution using `uvx garak@0.17.1 --list_probes`.
+- Zero changes to repository `requirements.txt` or package manifests.
+- Evaluated 30+ vulnerability probe modules and over 120 specific attack vectors across prompt injection, jailbreaking, data leakage, encoding bypasses, and system prompt extraction.
+
+---
+
+## 2. Active Probe Categories & Inventory
