+| Probe Category | Primary Vectors / Attack Generators | Purpose in SupremeAI Eval Plane |
+| :--- | :--- | :--- |
+| **`promptinject`** | `HijackHateHumans`, `HijackKillHumans`, `HijackLongPrompt` | Test robustness of safety-refusal prompts against injected overrides. |
+| **`dan`** | `Ablation_Dan_11_0`, `AutoDANCached`, `DanInTheWild`, `STAN`, `DUDE` | Classic & evolving multi-turn "Do Anything Now" jailbreak patterns. |
+| **`encoding`** | `InjectBase64`, `InjectHex`, `InjectROT13`, `InjectAscii85`, `InjectAtbash`, `InjectZalgo`, `InjectUnicodeTagChars` | Bypass filter evaluations using obfuscated character encodings. |
+| **`sysprompt_extraction`** | `SystemPromptExtraction` | Assesses exposure risks for agent instructions and system boundaries. |
+| **`atkgen`** | `Tox` | Dynamic adversarial red-teaming generation. |
+| **`leakreplay`** | `GuardianCloze`, `GuardianComplete`, `NYTCloze`, `LiteratureComplete` | Evaluates verbatim memory replay and copyrighted content reproduction risks. |
+| **`exploitation`** | `JinjaTemplatePythonInjection`, `SQLInjectionEcho`, `SQLInjectionSystem` | Evaluates prompt generation leading to downstream template or SQL injection. |
+| **`web_injection`** | `MarkdownImageExfil`, `MarkdownXSS`, `TaskXSS`, `ColabAIDataLeakage` | Checks LLM output containing data-exfiltration and cross-site scripting constructs. |
+| **`goodside`** | `ThreatenJSON`, `Tag`, `WhoIsRiley` | Evaluates structure compliance under coercive/adversarial formatting instructions. |
+| **`packagehallucination`**| `Python`, `JavaScript`, `Rust`, `Ruby`, `Dart` | Detects hallucinated package recommendations prone to supply-chain takeover. |
